  "thag1.8:0.4": "8. 8. Vīrattheragāthā ",
  "thag1.8:1.1": "‘‘Yo duddamiyo damena danto, ",
  "thag1.8:1.2": "vīro santusito vitiṇṇakaṅkho; ",
  "thag1.8:1.3": "Vijitāvī apetalomahaṃso, ",
  "thag1.8:1.4": "vīro so parinibbuto ṭhitatto’’ti. ",
  "thag1.8:1.5": "Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vīro thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthāti. "
}
